[
 {
  "i": 0,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "From what I heard, you're the one who took down that former Shichibukai Crocodile over there, huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 1,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw Hat Luffy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 2,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Back then, when I was still trying to become a Shichibukai,"
 },
 {
  "i": 3,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I thought the best idea was to kill you and use that to prove my strength to the World Government."
 },
 {
  "i": 4,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Whitebeard's reign is over!\\NI'll become the next Pirate King!"
 },
 {
  "i": 5,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "For starters, I'm gonna kill\\NStraw Hat Luffy, who is in Water Seven,"
 },
 {
  "i": 6,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "as a gift to the Government!"
 },
 {
  "i": 7,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Another reason I can't let you go free!"
 },
 {
  "i": 8,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's my brother!"
 },
 {
  "i": 9,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But it seems fate was in your favor!"
 },
 {
  "i": 10,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ace, who had been chasing me ever since I broke the laws of Whitebeard's ship,"
 },
 {
  "i": 11,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "just happened to be your brother!"
 },
 {
  "i": 12,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Once he realized that we were planning to kill his little brother,"
 },
 {
  "i": 13,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "he just had to fight us himself!"
 },
 {
  "i": 14,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You understand?"
 },
 {
  "i": 15,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If he'd let us go, not only would he have disgraced Whitebeard,"
 },
 {
  "i": 16,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but his brother would have been killed, too!"
 },
 {
  "i": 17,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There is no such thing as coincidence in one's fate."
 },
 {
  "i": 18,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Meaning..."
 },
 {
  "i": 19,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You got real lucky!"
 },
 {
  "i": 20,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now that the captain has become a Shichibukai, he has no need to take your life."
 },
 {
  "i": 21,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Your brother put up an admirable fight!"
 },
 {
  "i": 22,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You should be thankful for Ace's interference."
 },
 {
  "i": 23,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If he hadn't interfered, the one dying today, {here}"
 },
 {
  "i": 24,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "would be you, Straw Hat."
 },
 {
  "i": 25,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "In that case..."
 },
 {
  "i": 26,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "WHY DON'T YOU TRY KILLING ME NOW?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 27,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Captain!"
 },
 {
  "i": 28,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm not letting Ace die!"
 },
 {
  "i": 29,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Gomu Gomu no Jet..."
 },
 {
  "i": 30,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(200,200)}Black Vortex!"
 },
 {
  "i": 31,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw-chan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 32,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Blood? Isn't he a rubber man?"
 },
 {
  "i": 33,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Devil Fruit powers are useless against me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 34,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And so what?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 35,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait, Luffy-kun! Stop!{Jinbei just casually steps in the way of Luffy mid-attack. how cool is he?}"
 },
 {
  "i": 36,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let me go!"
 },
 {
  "i": 37,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is not the time! Just endure it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 38,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let go of me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 39,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You can't, Luffy-kun!"
 },
 {
  "i": 40,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's more important here?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 41,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Think! Luffy-kun!"
 },
 {
  "i": 42,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ever since he was on old Whitebeard's ship, no one's ever known his true nature."
 },
 {
  "i": 43,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't know what tricks he used, but he certainly possesses the power to defeat even Ace-san!"
 },
 {
  "i": 44,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We can't afford to waste time and energy here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 45,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If you get carried away and fight him now,"
 },
 {
  "i": 46,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "we won't have time to save Ace-san afterward!"
 },
 {
  "i": 47,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're even stronger than I had imagined."
 },
 {
  "i": 48,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Your haki has increased, too."
 },
 {
  "i": 49,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You said you're Blackbeard, right?"
 },
 {
  "i": 50,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'd heard that some no-name pirate from Whitebeard's crew had taken my place in the Shichibukai."
 },
 {
  "i": 51,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But isn't this odd?"
 },
 {
  "i": 52,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why would you, who's been called to Navy HQ, be down here right now?"
 },
 {
  "i": 53,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You're pretty much throwing away the\\NShichibukai rank that you wanted so badly."
 },
 {
  "i": 54,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's all part of my plan."
 },
 {
  "i": 55,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's not like I'm obligated to tell you anything..."
 },
 {
  "i": 56,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "...Mister Crocodile."
 },
 {
  "i": 57,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's true, and to be honest, I don't really care."
 },
 {
  "i": 58,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Pretty touchy, aren't you?"
 },
 {
  "i": 59,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "H-Hey wait! What's going on?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 60,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Magellan is here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 61,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is not good!"
 },
 {
  "i": 62,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw-Hat-boy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 63,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hurry up and go!"
 },
 {
  "i": 64,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If vyou're hit by any more of Magellan's poison, Vi won't be able to bring vyou back again!"
 },
 {
  "i": 65,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's Prison Warden Magellan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 66,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, crap... Hurry up and run!"
 },
 {
  "i": 67,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Warden... Magellan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 68,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Thank God... The Warden is here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 69,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Magellan... So he finally shows himself?"
 },
 {
  "i": 70,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Climb the stairs! The bazooka squad's gone!"
 },
 {
  "i": 71,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The path is clear!"
 },
 {
  "i": 72,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw Hat! Hurry and climb up to Level Three!"
 },
 {
  "i": 73,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You took out the guards blocking the stairs... That makes things easier for us."
 },
 {
  "i": 74,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Well, you guys helped us too.\\NAll this panic is real convenient for us."
 },
 {
  "i": 75,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Alright! It's the stairwell to Level Three!"
 },
 {
  "i": 76,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's get moving!"
 },
 {
  "i": 77,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's another Demon Guard!"
 },
 {
  "i": 78,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's the Minotaurus!"
 },
 {
  "i": 79,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What?! The Minotaurus?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 80,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Didn't we beat that thing back in Level Three?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 81,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Of course it recovered."
 },
 {
  "i": 82,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're awakened Zoan-type Fruit users."
 },
 {
  "i": 83,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're much tougher and recover much faster than normal people."
 },
 {
  "i": 84,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Those things are Devil Fruit users as well?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 85,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If we stay here for too long, the other three will get up again too."
 },
 {
  "i": 86,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But this is not the time to be scared of those things."
 },
 {
  "i": 87,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The boss of Hell is just around the corner."
 },
 {
  "i": 88,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Warden Magellan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 89,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've received word that Blackbeard is on this floor, at the stairwell to Level Three!"
 },
 {
  "i": 90,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Shiryuu should have already dealt with Blackbeard!"
 },
 {
  "i": 91,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Was he defeated?"
 },
 {
  "i": 92,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is the monitoring room!"
 },
 {
  "i": 93,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's happening?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 94,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I-It's terrible!"
 },
 {
  "i": 95,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The main Surveillance Snail was taken out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 96,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The monitoring system for the entire prison has been destroyed!"
 },
 {
  "i": 97,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's more, all connections to Navy HQ and the Government have been severed!"
 },
 {
  "i": 98,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've completely lost contact with{\\fscx250}-{\\r}"
 },
 {
  "i": 99,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's this?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 100,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey! What's wrong?! What happened?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 101,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Who did this?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 102,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't go tattling on me..."
 },
 {
  "i": 103,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Or Magellan will know I'm here."
 },
 {
  "i": 104,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've lost contact!"
 },
 {
  "i": 105,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Send someone to confirm the situation!"
 },
 {
  "i": 106,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yes, Sir!"
 },
 {
  "i": 107,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is not good."
 },
 {
  "i": 108,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If Blackbeard is on this floor,"
 },
 {
  "i": 109,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "it means he has unsealed the door that I sealed on Level Two!"
 },
 {
  "i": 110,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Everything seems to be going wrong here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 111,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This entire mess has broken out because we allowed one little mouse to break in!"
 },
 {
  "i": 112,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Buggy!{Socky}"
 },
 {
  "i": 113,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Mister Three!{supie}"
 },
 {
  "i": 114,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Buggy!{Socky}"
 },
 {
  "i": 115,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Mister Three!{supie}"
 },
 {
  "i": 116,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah! We got flashily lucky!"
 },
 {
  "i": 117,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Men! We're finally on Level One!"
 },
 {
  "i": 118,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Everyone! We're about to reach the outside, where the sun shines!"
 },
 {
  "i": 119,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Our great savior, Captain Buggy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 120,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm definitely going to save Ace!"
 },
 {
  "i": 121,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Sure, I won't say it's useless."
 },
 {
  "i": 122,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "After all, there's no such thing as \"impossible\" in this world."
 },
 {
  "i": 123,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Sky Island did exist, didn't it?"
 },
 {
  "i": 124,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The era where pirates dream is over?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 125,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Huh?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 126,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "People's dreams..."
 },
 {
  "i": 127,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "NEVER END!"
 },
 {
  "i": 128,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Ain't that right?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 129,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "One Piece is the same."
 },
 {
  "i": 130,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It definitely exists!"
 },
 {
  "i": 131,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Look forward to it, you guys!"
 },
 {
  "i": 132,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "In just a few hours,"
 },
 {
  "i": 133,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "we will give you all a show that'll shake the world to its core!"
 },
 {
  "i": 134,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't bother with him, Luffy-kun!"
 },
 {
  "i": 135,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Advance!"
 },
 {
  "i": 136,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "To Level Three!"
 },
 {
  "i": 137,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Warden!"
 },
 {
  "i": 138,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Help me, Warden!"
 },
 {
  "i": 139,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Sadi-chan! What happened to you?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 140,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Okamakov..."
 },
 {
  "i": 141,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Beat me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 142,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm so ashamed!"
 },
 {
  "i": 143,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's no reason for me to live if I can't torture people!"
 },
 {
  "i": 144,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let her down.{he should've left her there}"
 },
 {
  "i": 145,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll go on ahead."
 },
 {
  "i": 146,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Uh, yes! Right away!"
 },
 {
  "i": 147,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So you're Magellan?"
 },
 {
  "i": 148,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And I take it you are Blackbeard?"
 },
 {
  "i": 149,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I am indeed."
 },
 {
  "i": 150,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Hydra!"
 },
 {
  "i": 151,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't have time to ask why you're here."
 },
 {
  "i": 152,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It hurts! What is this?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 153,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Poison? Damn that bastard...!"
 },
 {
  "i": 154,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hannyabal."
 },
 {
  "i": 155,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You did well to hold them back for so long."
 },
 {
  "i": 156,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Leave the rest to me."
 },
 {
  "i": 157,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Assistant Warden!"
 },
 {
  "i": 158,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What a disgraceful appearance!"
 },
 {
  "i": 159,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Take care of him for me."
 },
 {
  "i": 160,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yes, Sir!"
 },
 {
  "i": 161,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Assistant Warden! Hang in there! Assistant Warden!"
 },
 {
  "i": 162,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't die."
 },
 {
  "i": 163,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I won't accept anyone but you as my successor."
 },
 {
  "i": 164,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw Hat..."
 },
 {
  "i": 165,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How did you survive my poison?"
 },
 {
  "i": 166,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm sure he's the one in charge of this whole incident."
 },
 {
  "i": 167,
  "style": "Thoughts",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I will absolutely finish him off this time!"
 },
 {
  "i": 168,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "STRAW HAT!!!"
 },
 {
  "i": 169,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Who's that?! Is that Magellan's voice?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 170,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's at the bottom of the stairs!\\NIf he catches up to us, we're finished!"
 },
 {
  "i": 171,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The poison guy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 172,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I will never let you get away!"
 },
 {
  "i": 173,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw-chan! Don't look back, just keep running!"
 },
 {
  "i": 174,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I won't let you get away."
 },
 {
  "i": 175,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Get moving!"
 },
 {
  "i": 176,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hurry! Magellan is close!"
 },
 {
  "i": 177,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hurry to Level Two!"
 },
 {
  "i": 178,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That was the last group."
 },
 {
  "i": 179,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Of all those behind them, not a single man was left standing!"
 },
 {
  "i": 180,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Inazuma."
 },
 {
  "i": 181,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Understood."
 },
 {
  "i": 182,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Great Scissors!"
 },
 {
  "i": 183,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Inazuma-san!"
 },
 {
  "i": 184,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why'd you slice up the stairs?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 185,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Iva-sama is still down there!"
 },
 {
  "i": 186,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Never mind that, just hurry and get off this floor!"
 },
 {
  "i": 187,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Please... Survive!"
 },
 {
  "i": 188,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What..."
 },
 {
  "i": 189,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Is the meaning of this?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 190,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "\"What is the meaning?\" vyou ask?"
 },
 {
  "i": 191,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If vyou don't understand what the meaning of that move was..."
 },
 {
  "i": 192,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Then vyou're..."
 },
 {
  "i": 193,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "A TOTAL IDIOT, AREN'T VYOU?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 194,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Death Wink!"
 },
 {
  "i": 195,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I won't let Straw Hat and the others escape while you're stalling for time!"
 },
 {
  "i": 196,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Stalling for time?"
 },
 {
  "i": 197,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vyou don't actually think you can {\\i1}beat{\\i0} me, do vyou?"
 },
 {
  "i": 198,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vi will show you the true power of the\\NNewkama Kenpo of the Kamabakka high temple!"
 },
 {
  "i": 199,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Alright, get out here! The outside world awaits you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 200,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Thank you, Captain Buggy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 201,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Alright!"
 },
 {
  "i": 202,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We're free!"
 },
 {
  "i": 203,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now make sure you work hard, alright?"
 },
 {
  "i": 204,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Here."
 },
 {
  "i": 205,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Thanks."
 },
 {
  "i": 206,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Take this."
 },
 {
  "i": 207,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Advance! Keep moving!"
 },
 {
  "i": 208,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Once trapped on Level Two by Magellan's poison but fortunately managing to escape,"
 },
 {
  "i": 209,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Captain Buggy and his merry prisoners are now heading to the front entrance."
 },
 {
  "i": 210,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They are currently on Level One."
 },
 {
  "i": 211,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Having made it through Level Four,\\NInferno Hell and Level Three, Famine Hell,"
 },
 {
  "i": 212,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Straw Hat Luffy, the Newkama troops he commands, and the released prisoners..."
 },
 {
  "i": 213,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "are now running through Level Two, the Accursed Beasts Floor."
 },
 {
  "i": 214,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And the ruler of Hell, Warden Magellan, who is trying to catch them,"
 },
 {
  "i": 215,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "is currently fighting Okama Queen Ivankov, on Level Three."
 },
 {
  "i": 216,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He broke..."
 },
 {
  "i": 217,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My spine..."
 },
 {
  "i": 218,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "D-Damn you, Ivankov!"
 },
 {
  "i": 219,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I won't forgive you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 220,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Get going!"
 },
 {
  "i": 221,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How long..."
 },
 {
  "i": 222,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Are you gonna sleep for?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 223,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And the four Demon Guards, having just recovered from their earlier beating,"
 },
 {
  "i": 224,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "are in the lift, heading for Level One."
 },
 {
  "i": 225,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The traitorous Head Jailer, Shiryuu, has blocked all communication with the outside world."
 },
 {
  "i": 226,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No one has received word on the current state of the prison."
 },
 {
  "i": 227,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "As this unprecedented incident continues to escalate beneath the sea..."
 },
 {
  "i": 228,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Warships and prison ships are stationed all around the prison!"
 },
 {
  "i": 229,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If we can hijack one of them, we should be able to reach Marineford before Ace-san is executed!"
 },
 {
  "i": 230,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right!"
 },
 {
  "i": 231,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Wait for me, Ace!"
 },
 {
  "i": 232,
  "style": "Narrator",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Four and a half hours remain before Ace's rapidly approaching execution."
 },
 {
  "i": 233,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Long-johns!"
 },
 {
  "i": 234,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Chemise!"
 },
 {
  "i": 235,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's weird..."
 },
 {
  "i": 236,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The poison guy was right behind us a second ago..."
 },
 {
  "i": 237,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Iva-san and Inazuma stopped him at the bottom of the stairwell!"
 },
 {
  "i": 238,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Then they're fighting against the poison guy right now?"
 },
 {
  "i": 239,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's go back!"
 },
 {
  "i": 240,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Stop kidding around!"
 },
 {
  "i": 241,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If they are fighting, then that makes it all the more important for us to move forward!"
 },
 {
  "i": 242,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's believe in the power of the Miracle Worker!"
 },
 {
  "i": 243,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Spin, spin!"
 },
 {
  "i": 244,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's wrong with this floor?"
 },
 {
  "i": 245,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's completely deserted."
 },
 {
  "i": 246,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Strange..."
 },
 {
  "i": 247,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's no sign of prisoners in any of the cells."
 },
 {
  "i": 248,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "And all the cells are already open, too!"
 },
 {
  "i": 249,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Who let them out?"
 },
 {
  "i": 250,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vmy face..."
 },
 {
  "i": 251,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "VMY FACE IS MELTING!"
 },
 {
  "i": 252,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vmy face... Vmy face...!"
 },
 {
  "i": 253,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vmy face... Vmy face...!"
 },
 {
  "i": 254,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's... It's... It's..."
 },
 {
  "i": 255,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "NOT MELTING!"
 },
 {
  "i": 256,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vi was just wearing lots of makeup!"
 },
 {
  "i": 257,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What a frivolous waste of time!"
 },
 {
  "i": 258,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Is that so?"
 },
 {
  "i": 259,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Vi found it funny, though."
 },
 {
  "i": 260,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Then how about vwe end this?"
 },
 {
  "i": 261,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This battle between vyou and vme?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 262,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Newkama Kenpo..."
 },
 {
  "i": 263,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,200)}Aesthetic Art 44 Hidden Technique..."
 },
 {
  "i": 264,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,200)}Dream Smash Removal Fist!"
 },
 {
  "i": 265,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Iva-san!"
 },
 {
  "i": 266,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Iva-san...!"
 },
 {
  "i": 267,
  "style": "Flashbacks",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It didn't work?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 268,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Keep Out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 269,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Another attempt to stall for time?"
 },
 {
  "i": 270,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 271,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We finally made it here, and now all four Demon Guards are here too!"
 },
 {
  "i": 272,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Run!"
 },
 {
  "i": 273,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is as far as we go! Let's turn back! We can't win!"
 },
 {
  "i": 274,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's just give up on escaping!"
 },
 {
  "i": 275,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "WHAAAAAT?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 276,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Are you alright?"
 },
 {
  "i": 277,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Hey! Watch it, you crock o{\\fscx250}-{\\r}"
 },
 {
  "i": 278,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "-DILE?! {Yeah, I couldn't really think of any way to make this sound good.kae: I went with 'crock of shit' getting truncated. it might be over-localized, but buggy is weird.}"
 },
 {
  "i": 279,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "B-B-B-B-Boss?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 280,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So it's you, Mister Three."
 },
 {
  "i": 281,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's a worthless piece of trash like you doing here?"
 },
 {
  "i": 282,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's quite a big shot they've released..."
 },
 {
  "i": 283,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "C-Captain Buggy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 284,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They've knocked out the Demon Guards!"
 },
 {
  "i": 285,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "S-Straw Hat?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 286,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I-Is that the Shichibukai, Jinbei?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 287,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What a relief! So you guys are alright?"
 },
 {
  "i": 288,
  "style": "Note",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(100,100)}(What a relief! So you guys are alright?)"
 },
 {
  "i": 289,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My heart!"
 },
 {
  "i": 290,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It hurts!"
 },
 {
  "i": 291,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Captain Buggy!"
 },
 {
  "i": 292,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Prisoners and perverts just keep coming up from Level Two!{what a line!}"
 },
 {
  "i": 293,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Perverts too?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 294,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What the hell?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 295,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Who're you calling perverts?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 296,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You two... How dare you abandon us back there?"
 },
 {
  "i": 297,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So you're here too, Mister Two?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 298,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What are you doing to Captain Buggy?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 299,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is bad!"
 },
 {
  "i": 300,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The prisoners from Level Four have finally made it up here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 301,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Did they manage to escape from Warden Magellan?"
 },
 {
  "i": 302,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How can this be?"
 },
 {
  "i": 303,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The two insurgent groups have joined forces!"
 },
 {
  "i": 304,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Where is the Warden?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 305,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Hydra!"
 },
 {
  "i": 306,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "MAGELLAN TOO?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 307,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "WHAT IS GOING ON HERE ON THIS FLOOR?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 308,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Huh?! Does that mean that Iva-chan and Crab-chan were..."
 },
 {
  "i": 309,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Dammit!"
 },
 {
  "i": 310,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You can't, Straw-chan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 311,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've got no choice but to run from Magellan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 312,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let go of me, Bon-chan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 313,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm gonna kick his ass!"
 },
 {
  "i": 314,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Are you sure?"
 },
 {
  "i": 315,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I understand, but do you really want us to?"
 },
 {
  "i": 316,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yes. Follow my orders, and do it quickly!"
 },
 {
  "i": 317,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yes, Sir!"
 },
 {
  "i": 318,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh no, so that's their plan?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 319,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You almost died because of him, remember?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 320,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But I'm still alive, aren't I?"
 },
 {
  "i": 321,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Miracles are called that because they won't happen twice, you know!"
 },
 {
  "i": 322,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You two, hurry to the next floor!"
 },
 {
  "i": 323,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy-kun!"
 },
 {
  "i": 324,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We must hurry to the main entrance!"
 },
 {
  "i": 325,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The situation has gotten worse..."
 },
 {
  "i": 326,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've been too focused on Magellan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 327,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Hydra!"
 },
 {
  "i": 328,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Everyone, get out of the way!"
 },
 {
  "i": 329,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Candle Wall!"
 },
 {
  "i": 330,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Three!"
 },
 {
  "i": 331,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He stopped Magellan's Hydra!"
 },
 {
  "i": 332,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That optimism of yours makes me want to puke!"
 },
 {
  "i": 333,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The second I let my guard down, I start thinking of you as a friend!"
 },
 {
  "i": 334,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Sheesh..."
 },
 {
  "i": 335,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I hate being indebted to others!"
 },
 {
  "i": 336,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I've underestimated you, Brother Three!"
 },
 {
  "i": 337,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I see. Wax, huh?"
 },
 {
  "i": 338,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's right."
 },
 {
  "i": 339,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I ate the Doru Doru fruit. I'm a candle-man."
 },
 {
  "i": 340,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Your poison will never be able to pass through my hard-as-steel wax wall!"
 },
 {
  "i": 341,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You never know how suitable some powers can be."
 },
 {
  "i": 342,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now, hurry up and go!"
 },
 {
  "i": 343,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I give up quickly, you know!"
 },
 {
  "i": 344,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Three!"
 },
 {
  "i": 345,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "How irritating."
 },
 {
  "i": 346,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is no time to be hesitating! I can't hold him back for long!"
 },
 {
  "i": 347,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right. Then we'll just get going."
 },
 {
  "i": 348,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's go, men!"
 },
 {
  "i": 349,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Were you always this good?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 350,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah, as long as I'm not on a hot floor..."
 },
 {
  "i": 351,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now all of you, hurry and get out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 352,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I want to escape too, you know!"
 },
 {
  "i": 353,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Luffy-kun. We must hurry as well!"
 },
 {
  "i": 354,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Oh, yeah, you said we're gonna steal a warship, right?"
 },
 {
  "i": 355,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I did."
 },
 {
  "i": 356,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Then you and the others should just go on ahead."
 },
 {
  "i": 357,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll try stopping the poison guy in the meantime."
 },
 {
  "i": 358,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I mean, it'll be hard to steal one while he's chasing us."
 },
 {
  "i": 359,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yes, that's true..."
 },
 {
  "i": 360,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I've got an idea."
 },
 {
  "i": 361,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Does it stand a chance?"
 },
 {
  "i": 362,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Yeah, leave it to me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 363,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I understand. Just don't do anything too reckless!"
 },
 {
  "i": 364,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right, Three! Let's fight together!"
 },
 {
  "i": 365,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No, that's wrong! I have absolutely no intention of fighting!"
 },
 {
  "i": 366,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "My only intent was to guard us the best I could and run away!"
 },
 {
  "i": 367,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Brother Three! We'll stay behind and help, too!"
 },
 {
  "i": 368,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm telling you, I'm not that motivated!"
 },
 {
  "i": 369,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "THIS IS JUST TOO COOL!"
 },
 {
  "i": 370,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's perfect!"
 },
 {
  "i": 371,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Pay attention to what's in front of you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 372,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What are you talking about, at a time like this?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 373,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The tears just won't stop...!"
 },
 {
  "i": 374,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Thanks for making me look so awesome...!"
 },
 {
  "i": 375,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Like I care! Hurry up and fight him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 376,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "H-Here he comes!"
 },
 {
  "i": 377,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Hydra!"
 },
 {
  "i": 378,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Candle Wall!"
 },
 {
  "i": 379,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Three!"
 },
 {
  "i": 380,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Leave it to me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 381,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No matter how many times you try, it won't work!"
 },
 {
  "i": 382,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Gomu Gomu no..."
 },
 {
  "i": 383,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Champion Rifle!"
 },
 {
  "i": 384,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Alright! I can touch him now!"
 },
 {
  "i": 385,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We've got the cannons ready over here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 386,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The candle wall is shielding us!"
 },
 {
  "i": 387,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Awesome! We hit him!"
 },
 {
  "i": 388,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We can do this!"
 },
 {
  "i": 389,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Alright!"
 },
 {
  "i": 390,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We're almost there! Push for the surface!"
 },
 {
  "i": 391,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Just a little further!"
 },
 {
  "i": 392,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We can finally get out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 393,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Since we've made it this far, there's nobody left who can call themselves our enemies!"
 },
 {
  "i": 394,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't let your guard down, amateur."
 },
 {
  "i": 395,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 396,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Outside these walls, there are at least ten warships."
 },
 {
  "i": 397,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There are about eight hundred marines on each ship."
 },
 {
  "i": 398,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't know what kind of plan they've got to intercept us,"
 },
 {
  "i": 399,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but stealing one of the ships means we'll be making the other ships our enemies."
 },
 {
  "i": 400,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This is no time to take it easy."
 },
 {
  "i": 401,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I-I see..."
 },
 {
  "i": 402,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "That's not the only problem here."
 },
 {
  "i": 403,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's no guards left!"
 },
 {
  "i": 404,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now we just have to get through this door!"
 },
 {
  "i": 405,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right! Prepare your weapons, all of you!"
 },
 {
  "i": 406,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's open the door!"
 },
 {
  "i": 407,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Let's do this! Ready, push!"
 },
 {
  "i": 408,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Finally, we'll see the light of the outside world!"
 },
 {
  "i": 409,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Idiot! We're not out of this just yet!"
 },
 {
  "i": 410,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The navy troops are waiting right outside this door..."
 },
 {
  "i": 411,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If we win, we'll reach Heaven! If we lose, we'll go to Hell!"
 },
 {
  "i": 412,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's light!"
 },
 {
  "i": 413,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We're getting out of here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 414,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "All of you, put some spirit into it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 415,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't know how many troops are waiting for us, but we {\\i1}will{\\i0} beat 'em and return to sea!"
 },
 {
  "i": 416,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now, let's go, men!"
 },
 {
  "i": 417,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Now, let's go, men!"
 },
 {
  "i": 418,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Follow my lead!"
 },
 {
  "i": 419,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What... is going on here?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 420,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There aren't any warships around!"
 },
 {
  "i": 421,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's not a single warship for us to steal!"
 },
 {
  "i": 422,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There isn't a single marine here, either!"
 },
 {
  "i": 423,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "No way... That means..."
 },
 {
  "i": 424,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's no way out, is there?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 425,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What are we gonna do?"
 },
 {
  "i": 426,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Is there nothing to do..."
 },
 {
  "i": 427,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "but wait helplessly for Magellan to arrive?"
 },
 {
  "i": 428,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Damn it! You gotta be kidding me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 429,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I see. So the enemy wasn't as stupid as I thought."
 },
 {
  "i": 430,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "The great Sea Kings are lurking on the ocean floor."
 },
 {
  "i": 431,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "This Calm Belt here is truly\\NImpel Down's greatest defense."
 },
 {
  "i": 432,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We finally made it all the way here, from the depths of Hell!"
 },
 {
  "i": 433,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Damn! At this rate, we'll only fall right back into Hell!"
 },
 {
  "i": 434,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "We have no time to stand around crying!"
 },
 {
  "i": 435,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Magellan ordered them to set sail just a few minutes ago."
 },
 {
  "i": 436,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Take a good look!"
 },
 {
  "i": 437,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You can still barely see their shadows through the mist!"
 },
 {
  "i": 438,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Y-You're right!"
 },
 {
  "i": 439,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But how is being able to see them in the distance gonna help us?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 440,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't worry!"
 },
 {
  "i": 441,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm here! You can leave this to me!"
 },
 {
  "i": 442,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Seriously?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 443,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's freakishly strong!"
 },
 {
  "i": 444,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "All those who have the resolve to fight, get on!"
 },
 {
  "i": 445,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Right, let's move out!"
 },
 {
  "i": 446,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Very well! Let us hurry!"
 },
 {
  "i": 447,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He's surging forward while carrying that heavy door!"
 },
 {
  "i": 448,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Just what I'd expect from the captain of the Fishman Pirates!"
 },
 {
  "i": 449,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'm really getting excited here!"
 },
 {
  "i": 450,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I never thought I'd see a Shichibukai in action!"
 },
 {
  "i": 451,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Not only that, but our savior, Captain Buggy, is with them!"
 },
 {
  "i": 452,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "There's still hope for us!"
 },
 {
  "i": 453,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You dumbasses!"
 },
 {
  "i": 454,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's obviously much safer with these Shichibukai than staying there and dreading Magellan!"
 },
 {
  "i": 455,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Fools!"
 },
 {
  "i": 456,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They're shooting at us!"
 },
 {
  "i": 457,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "So they spotted us. {sexy voice}"
 },
 {
  "i": 458,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "He dodged it! He's fast!"
 },
 {
  "i": 459,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't think he's just any fishman! He's the Sea Knight, Jinbei!"
 },
 {
  "i": 460,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "All ships, fire!"
 },
 {
  "i": 461,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If we just sink Jinbei, they're all done for!"
 },
 {
  "i": 462,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Warships coming in hard and fast!"
 },
 {
  "i": 463,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I'll launch you onto the deck of one of the ships! Hold on tight!"
 },
 {
  "i": 464,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What?! What did you say?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 465,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You damn fish!"
 },
 {
  "i": 466,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "You listening, bastard?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 467,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "WHAT IS GOING ON?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 468,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I see! He abandoned us and ran off on his own!"
 },
 {
  "i": 469,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "TRAITOR! TRAITOR! TRAITOR! TRAITOR!"
 },
 {
  "i": 470,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Why did you even come along?"
 },
 {
  "i": 471,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They'll hit us if this keeps up!"
 },
 {
  "i": 472,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Just calm down, you."
 },
 {
  "i": 473,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(0,150)}Fishman Jujutsu..."
 },
 {
  "i": 474,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Water Heart..."
 },
 {
  "i": 475,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "IT'S COMING THIS WAY!"
 },
 {
  "i": 476,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "{\\fad(150,150)}Sea Current Lifter!"
 },
 {
  "i": 477,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "WE'RE FLYING!"
 },
 {
  "i": 478,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What's that water pillar?"
 },
 {
  "i": 479,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "It's almost like a living creature!"
 },
 {
  "i": 480,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "What could that be?!"
 },
 {
  "i": 481,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "I don't know."
 },
 {
  "i": 482,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "But someone's riding it... It's Crocodile!"
 },
 {
  "i": 483,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Here they are!"
 },
 {
  "i": 484,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "They've come to steal the ship!"
 },
 {
  "i": 485,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Don't let them take it!"
 },
 {
  "i": 486,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "If we can push the Devil Fruit users into the ocean, we win!"
 },
 {
  "i": 487,
  "style": "Main",
  "name": "",
  "text": "Huh?"
 }
]